        <item>What is X-Pose Tracker?</item>
        <item>How does X Pose Tracker work?</item>
        <item>How do I use the X Pose Tracker application?</item>
        <item>Can I use the X Pose Tracker application without an internet connection?</item>
        <item>Will my video data be saved or shared?</item>
        <item>What tests can I do with this application?</item>
        <item>Can this application be used to record participants during the test?</item>
        <item>Is this application compatible with all Android phones?</item>
        <item>What happens if the system misidentifies my movements?</item>
        <item>Contact Developer</item>
    </string-array>

    <string-array name="faq_answers">
        <item>X Pose Tracker is an Android-based application designed to detect and count movements in physical fitness tests such as push-ups, sit-ups, pull-ups, and lunges using Human Pose Estimation technology and the BiLSTM artificial intelligence model.</item>
        <item>X Pose Tracker is an application that uses pose estimation technology to monitor push-ups, sit-ups, pull-ups, and lunges in real time, count repetitions, and record your workout progress!</item>
        <item>Please see the video tutorial on how to use the X Pose Tracker application in the tutorial menu.</item>
        <item>Yes. You can use the X Pose Tracker application without an internet connection.</item>
        <item>No. Your privacy is very important to us. The X Pose Tracker application does not save or share video data to any server. All processing takes place locally on your device.</item>
        <item>X Pose Tracker supports push-ups, sit-ups, pull-ups, and lunges.</item>
        <item>Yes. The X Pose Tracker application can be used to record participants during the test.</item>
        <item>Yes. The X Pose Tracker application is compatible with all Android phones.</item>
        <item>Ensure you are in sufficient lighting, the camera is in the ideal position (parallel to your body), and you are wearing clothing that does not obscure your body shape. If the error persists, you can send feedback via the available contact details.</item>
        <item>If you have any questions, suggestions, or want to report a bug, please contact us via the following email address: muhammadrifqi20001@gmail.com</item>
    </string-array>
